{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-56394","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65398","text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol — Implementation Build Prompt"}]},{"id":"blk-56395","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65399","marks":["bold"],"text":"Version:"},{"id":"spn-65400","text":" 1.0 | "},{"id":"spn-65401","marks":["bold"],"text":"Date:"},{"id":"spn-65402","text":" April 2026 | "},{"id":"spn-65403","marks":["bold"],"text":"Type:"},{"id":"spn-65404","text":" Full Implementation (OTP Supervision Tree + MCP)"}]},{"id":"blk-56396","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65405","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56397","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65406","text":"Your Mission"}]},{"id":"blk-56398","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65407","text":"You are building the "},{"id":"spn-65408","marks":["bold"],"text":"OS-008 Agent Harness Protocol"},{"id":"spn-65409","text":" — the enforcement runtime that sits above agents and below humans. The harness orchestrates [&] pipelines, enforces governance contracts, gates execution on epistemic confidence, and ensures no agent skips retrieval, fabricates provenance, or acts beyond its coverage."}]},{"id":"blk-56399","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65410","marks":["bold"],"text":"Read `docs/spec/OS-008-HARNESS.md` fully before writing a single line."},{"id":"spn-65411","text":" It is the authoritative spec."}]},{"id":"blk-56400","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65412","text":"OS-008 is the "},{"id":"spn-65413","marks":["bold"],"text":"enforcement layer"},{"id":"spn-65414","text":" of the dark factory pipeline:"}]},{"id":"blk-56401","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"SpecPrompt (spec in) → Agentelic (build) → OS-008 (enforce) → FleetPrompt (distribute) → RuneFort (observe)"},{"id":"blk-56402","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65415","text":"The harness wraps agents like an OTP supervisor wraps processes — it doesn't do the work, it ensures the work is done correctly."}]},{"id":"blk-56403","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65416","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56404","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65417","text":"Target Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-56405","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:      Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nOTP Patterns:  DynamicSupervisor, GenServer, GenStateMachine\nMCP:           JSON-RPC over HTTP (harness_start_session, harness_sprint_status,\n               harness_approve_action, harness_escalation_response)\nIntegration:   Graphonomous MCP (memory), Delegatic (policy), OS-006 (permissions)\nAuth:          Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — workspace-scoped sessions)\nTesting:       ExUnit + property-based testing for state machine transitions\nDeploy:        Part of OpenSentience runtime (not standalone)"},{"id":"blk-56406","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65418","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56407","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65419","text":"Repository Structure"}]},{"id":"blk-56408","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65420","text":"Create this structure inside "},{"id":"spn-65421","marks":["code"],"text":"opensentience.org/lib/"},{"id":"spn-65422","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-56409","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"opensentience.org/\n├── lib/\n│   ├── open_sentience/\n│   │   ├── harness/\n│   │   │   ├── supervisor.ex           # DynamicSupervisor for harness sessions\n│   │   │   ├── session.ex              # Session GenServer — supervises one orchestrated task\n│   │   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer.ex    # Prerequisite constraint model (section 5)\n│   │   │   ├── quality_gate.ex         # Evaluator orchestrator (section 6)\n│   │   │   ├── contract_validator.ex   # [&] governance block enforcement (section 7)\n│   │   │   ├── sprint_controller.ex    # GenStateMachine — planner→generator→evaluator loop (section 9)\n│   │   │   ├── context_manager.ex      # Context window management + compaction (section 8)\n│   │   │   ├── coverage.ex             # Coverage→dispatch routing matrix (section 3.3)\n│   │   │   ├── audit_entry.ex          # Extended audit entry with provenance (section 10)\n│   │   │   ├── tier_adapter.ex         # Model tier adaptation (section 11)\n│   │   │   └── telemetry.ex            # :telemetry events for harness operations\n│   │   ├── harness.ex                  # Public API — start_session, sprint_status, etc.\n│   │   └── harness_mcp/\n│   │       ├── server.ex               # MCP JSON-RPC server (section 13)\n│   │       └── tools.ex                # Tool definitions and handlers\n│   └── open_sentience.ex              # Add harness supervisor to application tree\n├── test/\n│   ├── harness/\n│   │   ├── pipeline_enforcer_test.exs\n│   │   ├── quality_gate_test.exs\n│   │   ├── contract_validator_test.exs\n│   │   ├── sprint_controller_test.exs\n│   │   ├── context_manager_test.exs\n│   │   ├── coverage_test.exs\n│   │   └── session_test.exs\n│   └── fixtures/\n│       ├── customer_support_governance.json   # [&] governance block\n│       ├── sprint_contract.json               # Sample sprint contract\n│       └── coverage_scenarios.json            # Coverage→dispatch test cases\n├── mix.exs\n├── Dockerfile\n└── fly.toml"},{"id":"blk-56410","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65423","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-56411","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65424","text":"Implementation Order"}]},{"id":"blk-56412","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-65425","text":"Phase 1: Pipeline Enforcer (weeks 1-3)"}]},{"id":"blk-56413","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65426","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-65427","marks":["bold"],"text":"Implement PipelineEnforcer"},{"id":"spn-65428","text":" ("},{"id":"spn-65429","marks":["code"],"text":"harness/pipeline_enforcer.ex"},{"id":"spn-65430","text":")"}]},{"id":"blk-56414","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56416","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65431","text":"GenServer tracking stage state machine: "},{"id":"spn-65432","marks":["code"],"text":":idle → :retrieving → :analyzing → :deliberating → :acting → :storing"}]}],"id":"blk-56415","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65433","text":"Prerequisite rules from section 5.1:"}]}],"id":"blk-56417","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65434","marks":["code"],"text":"{:any, :write}"},{"id":"spn-65435","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65436","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :retrieve_context}"}]}],"id":"blk-56419","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56422","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65437","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :deliberate}"},{"id":"spn-65438","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65439","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :topology_analyze}"}]}],"id":"blk-56421","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65440","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :execute_action}"},{"id":"spn-65441","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65442","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :coverage_query}"}]}],"id":"blk-56423","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56426","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65443","marks":["code"],"text":"{:call, :learn_from_outcome}"},{"id":"spn-65444","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65445","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :execute_action}"}]}],"id":"blk-56425","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65446","marks":["code"],"text":"{:session, :complete}"},{"id":"spn-65447","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65448","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :store_node}"}]}],"id":"blk-56427","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-65449","marks":["code"],"text":"{:sprint, :advance}"},{"id":"spn-65450","text":" requires "},{"id":"spn-65451","marks":["code"],"text":"{:completed, :quality_gate, result: :pass}"}]}],"id":"blk-56429","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-56432","kind":"paragraph","s